windmill-lite uses openapi.yaml only as a test input: the API-surface test
in ../openapi_test.go reads it and checks that every operation the oracle
client calls is in it. Its references to ../../openflow.openapi.yaml resolve
to the copy vendored in ../../openflow/schema/. No code is generated from it.
